cale view.\n- Fixed overly-shiny An-64 bombs and several other materials.\n- Bullet tracers are less bright.", "created_date": 1785926962, "id": "27631755346488898", "version": "1.20", "version_code": 345, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24347870634877402", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27631755346488898"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1741407059854648"}]}, "change_log": "Fixed an issue where HorizonOS v2.3 broke boundary suppression.", "created_date": 1778604307, "id": "26627705583560551", "version": "1.15", "version_code": 333, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24347870634877402", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27631755346488898"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1741407059854648"}]}, "change_log": "Added dynamic occlusion. (Enable in menu; off by default.)\nSwitched to Vulkan graphics API.\nIncreased length of SR-71 afterburner flame.\nFixed gun fire sound continuing after you grab a plane.", "created_date": 1778273773, "id": "26582193541445089", "version": "1.14", "version_code": 332, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24347870634877402", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27631755346488898"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1741407059854648"}]}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1777400436, "id": "26465771023087342", "version": "1.13a", "version_code": 294, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24347870634877402", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27631755346488898"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1741407059854648"}]}, "change_log": "Added an options menu on the left controller's \"start\" button.\nAdded a control map diagram on the options menu.\nAdded an option to swap controllers for \"lefties\".\nAdded gun recoil forces; they're relatively small but fun.\nFixed controllers becoming visible due to faster startup time.\nFixed overly-dark F/A-18F ambient occlusion.\nFixed cockpit-tractoring activation outside of F4U.", "created_date": 1777398349, "id": "26465443083120136", "version": "1.13", "version_code": 291, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}